 385:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *       <td>On successful operation.</td>
 386:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *     </tr>
 387:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *     <tr>
 388:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *       <td>CYBLE_ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER</td>
 389:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *       <td>On passing a NULL pointer to the function. 
 390:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *		</td>
 391:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *     </tr>
 392:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *     <tr>
 393:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *       <td>CYBLE_ERROR_REPEATED_ATTEMPTS</td>
 394:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *       <td>On invoking this function more than once without calling CyBle_Shutdown() 
 395:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *           function between calls to this function.</td>
 396:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *     </tr>
 397:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c **** *     <tr>
