1054:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     * Function Name: CyBle_GapcConnectDevice
1055:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     ***************************************************************************//**
1056:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     * 
1057:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  This function is used to send a connection request to the remote device with
ARM GAS  C:\Users\ARTEM\AppData\Local\Temp\ccm8CtGO.s 			page 20


1058:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  the connection parameters set in the component customizer. This function needs
1059:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  to be called only once after the target device is discovered by 
1060:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  CyBle_GapcStartScan() and further scanning has stopped. Scanning is 
1061:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  successfully stopped on invoking CyBle_GapcStopScan() and then receiving the
1062:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  event CYBLE_EVT_GAPC_SCAN_START_STOP with sub-parameter 'success' = 0x01u.
1063:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  
1064:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  On successful connection, the following events are generated at the GAP 
