1272:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     /******************************************************************************
1273:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     * Function Name: CyBle_GapSetLocalName
1274:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     ***************************************************************************//**
1275:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  This function is used to set the local device name - a Characteristic of the 
1276:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  GAP Service. If the characteristic length entered in the component customizer
1277:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  is shorter than the string specified by the "name" parameter, the local device
1278:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  name will be cut to the length specified in the customizer.
1279:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     * 
1280:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *  \param name: The local device name string. The name string to be written as
1281:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *              the local device name. It represents a UTF-8 encoded User
1282:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *              Friendly Descriptive Name for the device. The length of the local
1283:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *              device string is entered into the component customizer and it can
1284:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *              be set to a value from 0 to 248 bytes. If the name contained in
1285:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *              the parameter is shorter than the length from the customizer, the
1286:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     *              end of the name is indicated by a NULL octet (0x00).
1287:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth.c ****     * 
